      "decision_index": 123,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Opponent is at 3 life with no creatures on board. Attacking with both Overlord of the Balemurk (5/5) and Formidable Speaker (2/4) would deal 7 damage total, which is lethal through any single blocker the opponent could produce (e.g., activating Restless Anchorage as a 2/3). Attacking with only Overlord risks the opponent blocking with an activated Restless Anchorage to survive at 3 life.",
      "action_taken": "Attacked with only Overlord of the Balemurk (5/5)",
